## =====================================================================
## .gitignore untuk Proyek Loka (Windows Web Development Environment)
## =====================================================================

### 1. Build & Compilation Outputs (Wajib di-ignore agar tidak mengotori repo)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
dist/
dist-app/
build/
out/
publish/
*_wpftmp.*
*.tmp


### 2. Large Installer Binaries & Staging (PENTING: GitHub tolak file >100MB)
release/
artifacts/cache/
artifacts/staging/
artifacts/*.zip
artifacts/*.tar.gz
artifacts/*.7z
artifacts/*.exe
Loka.Installer/Payload/*.zip
*.exe
*.msi
*.exe.sha256
checksums.txt


### 3. Local Runtime & Test Directories (Sample/Testing lokal di luar source code)
pgsql/
laravel/
test-projects/
temp/
tmp/

### 4. Visual Studio / IDE Files
.vs/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
*.ide/
*.swp
*~

### 5. NuGet & Dependencies Cache
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/packages/

### 6. Crash Dumps & Profiling
*.stackdump
*.dmp
*.crash
*.mdmp

### 7. Certificates & Private Keys (Keamanan: jangan bocorkan sertifikat lokal)
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
!Assets/**/*.ico
!Assets/**/*.png
!Assets/**/*.svg

### 8. OS Generated Files
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

### 9. Environment & Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

### 10. AI Prompts & Scratch Files (Dikecualikan agar repo bersih)
Agent.md
Button.md
Desain.md
Diagnosa.md
Fitur.md
Fix.md
Test.md
UX.md
Ui.md
installasi.md
desktop_screenshot.png
*.prompt.md
*.bak
*.stale*
APP_README.md
README_APP.md


